{"2707360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Atan", "steam_appid": 2707360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3066420], "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our community!</h1><p><br>Atan is a student project made by a passionate team from Breda University of Applied Sciences. <br><br>We want to hear what you think of the game! Feel free to join and share your opinion and give us feedback so we can improve the game. We are looking forward to hear from you!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2>Atan is an action-adventure game where you traverse a massive colossus. Use your climbing skills together with your bow and anchors to journey over the massive giant. But beware, because this rough terrain contains many challenges, for the colossus itself is still alive and in need of your help.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2>There exists an ancient, colossal creature, who holds up the sky. Living on this giant’s back is an unassuming child, who is about to embark on the journey of a lifetime. Travel up the colossus, traverse various challenges and dangerous obstacles, and meet various inhabitants of the colossus.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2>Atan is an action-adventure game where you traverse a massive colossus. Use your climbing skills together with your bow and anchors to journey over the massive giant. But beware, because this rough terrain contains many challenges, for the colossus itself is still alive and in need of your help.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2>There exists an ancient, colossal creature, who holds up the sky. Living on this giant’s back is an unassuming child, who is about to embark on the journey of a lifetime. Travel up the colossus, traverse various challenges and dangerous obstacles, and meet various inhabitants of the colossus.", "short_description": "Scale a massive colossus in this action-adventure climbing game. Find your way through atmospheric scenery and master your climbing skills. Atan was made by third year students of Breda University. Winner of the 2025 BAFTA Student Award!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707360/header.jpg?t=1751467821", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751467821", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751467821", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 @2.60 GHz or higher / AMD Ryzen 5 @3.00 GH or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 4GB VRAM or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 @2.60 GHz or higher / AMD Ryzen 5 @3.00 GH or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2060 6GB VRAM or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Goober Inc."], "publishers": ["Breda University of Applied Sciences"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 23, "description"